# Stage 11 — Chapter reviews + quality gate (GATE)

For each chapter, run the three reviews and the gate, then promote to final.

1. Fidelity review -> `qa/fidelity/{NNN_slug}.md` (meaning, tone, no add/drop).
2. Readability + imagery review -> `qa/readability/{NNN_slug}.md` and
   `qa/imagery/{NNN_slug}.imagery.md` (natural {{ target_lang }}, no metaphor
   collisions, no added drama, no over-compression).
3. Terminology review -> `qa/terminology/{NNN_slug}.md` (consistency vs
   `glossary/terms.csv`; scan for `forbidden_body_renderings`).
4. Chapter gate -> `qa/gates/{NNN_slug}.gate.md` with `result: PASS` only when all
   reviews pass. On PASS, copy the chapter to `chapters/final/{NNN_slug}.md`
   (apply the title policy: produce nav_label / page_title / subtitle).

When every chapter has a PASS gate and a `chapters/final/` file, call
`record_gate('chapter_gates', 'PASS')` then `set_state` -> `CHAPTER_GATES_PASS`,
step `11_chapter_quality_gate`.

Exit condition: all chapters reviewed, gated PASS, and present in chapters/final/.
